-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"200\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;프리젠테이션</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">30명</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"200\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;워드프로세싱(한글2007)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">30명</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 시험 응시방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 시험실시전 지정된 사이트에서 시험접수 / 응시료 납입</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 시험 접수 사이트</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(11월 30일~ 12월 2일 접수가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.icdl.co.kr/main/exam_gate.asp?code=ODMwNzI0MTg0MQ==\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://www.icdl.co.kr/main/exam_gate.asp?code=ODMwNzI0MTg0MQ==</span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">ICDL과정 수강자만 접수 가능<br>ICDL A반 수강생(워드,프리젠테이션)은 A과정만 신청가능<br>ICDL B반 수강생(엑셀,엑세스)도 동일하게 B과정만 신청가능<br>과정 출석부에 등록되지 않았으므로 응시료 지원불가함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 지원자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">우리대학교&nbsp; ICDL과정(10월~11월) 수강자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 응시료 지원&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 교육역량강화사업 ICDL과정(10월~11월) 수강자에 한함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 취업정보센터의 지원규정에 따라 12월 17일까지 취득한 자에 한하여 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;응시료 지원 받을 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※차후 자격증 취득 후 취업정보센터 공지사항에 따라 지원 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;단, 지원 자격을 갖춘 자 중 선착순으로 지원하며 사업비 소진 시 지원 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">문의 : 인적자원개발센터 (054-478-7241)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
